  "id": "bia",
  "term": "BIA",
  "definition": "BIA stands for bioelectrical impedance analysis, a non-invasive method used to estimate body composition. In mental health settings such as anorexia nervosa treatment, it can help monitor changes in body compartments like fat-free mass, skeletal muscle mass, and body water that are not shown by weight or BMI alone.",
